# Build-context hygiene for the three images built with context `.`
# (apps/{lore-api,floor,lore-station}/Dockerfile). Keeps installed deps, git
# history, local DB data, and worktree checkouts out of the daemon upload —
# nothing here is COPY'd by any Dockerfile.
**/node_modules
.git
**/.next
.lore-*data
**/coverage
**/.env*
.claude/worktrees
